# Annotation Property: <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/depiction> (<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/depiction>)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/depiction> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon.owl>)

# Annotation Property: <https://w3id.org/sssom/mapping_justification> (<https://w3id.org/sssom/mapping_justification>)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/sssom/mapping_justification> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon.owl>)


